WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Hey, what’s going on?

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.468
I’m Kevin Hart.

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.802
 And I'm Kenan Thompson. 

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.104
It's been one hell of a year!

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:05.839
We’re gonna look back at 
all the stuff that you remember.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.540
And all the moments that
 you wish you could forget. 

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:13.279
I sent you something 
that you could put to use.

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:14.614
A vending machine
full of condoms. 

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:15.715
You got him on that one.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:19.586
Your Eagles! Who did they lose
to last year? The Buccaneers! 

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:20.520
You motherf---r!

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.555
How much do you think you 
would sell Black Twitter for? 

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.356
$1500 right now! 

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.257
I need the money for rent. 

